-- Both arms of a neural plan-enumerated if are constant lists. Before the
-- planDetGuard fix the interpreter answered 1.0 at every cdf query (list `>`
-- is never True there) and Python crashed whenever every head compared
-- greater. [0.0] and [1.0] each have mass 0.5; both list-cdf conventions
-- agree on the rows below.
-- Task plan-det-guard-compares-composite-values-with-greater-than.
neural nn :: (Symbol -> Float)
main s = draw x = nn s in if x < 0.0 then [0.0] else [1.0]
